        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751480601": {
            "id": "751480601",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，终于爬上来了，没想到这里这么高，不过倒是没有想象中那么冷呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751480602"
            ]
          },
          "751480602": {
            "id": "751480602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "波嗯，唔…呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751480603"
            ]
          },
          "751480603": {
            "id": "751480603",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你皮糙肉厚，当然不怕冷啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751480604"
            ]
          },
          "751480604": {
            "id": "751480604",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那里就是火山口…还挺壮观的呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751480605"
            ]
          },
          "751480605": {
            "id": "751480605",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔，之前问路的时候，不是说火山口聚集了海量的气态燃素…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751480606"
            ]
          },
          "751480606": {
            "id": "751480606",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "看来得找找怎么下去的办法。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751480607"
            ]
          },
          "751480607": {
            "id": "751480607",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "咦，说起来，那个是什么…看上去像是个奇怪的雕像？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751480608"
            ]
          },
          "751480608": {
            "id": "751480608",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，难道这就是之前基莫西说的，被绒翼龙偷走的雕像？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751480609"
            ]
          },
          "751480609": {
            "id": "751480609",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！"
          }
        }
      }
